{"unit_id":"TINGOD2006__dsh-tps#card-zh","repo":"TINGOD2006/dsh-tps","commit":"155892f2515a1acb93b17b5fda50817a7905527e","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tps 是一款 DSH 会话吞吐监视插件，可在网页或桌面客户端的侧栏显示卡片，也可切换为可拖动悬浮窗。它订阅 assistant 流式分片和会话事件，按会话估算实时 tokens/s，并结合精确用量校准；卡片提供实时或平均速度、输出趋势、会话列表与任务标题。适合希望观察模型生成速度、比较不同会话输出状态的 DSH 用户。安装后由 webServer 提供状态和组件接口，不需要额外密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:121-185","lib/tracker.js:250-353","lib/widget.js:489-519"]}
{"unit_id":"TINGOD2006__dsh-tps#card-en","repo":"TINGOD2006/dsh-tps","commit":"155892f2515a1acb93b17b5fda50817a7905527e","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-tps shows session tokens-per-second in the DSH sidebar or a draggable card. It tracks assistant streams to display live and average speed, recent samples, and readings for other sessions. Use it to monitor model output. It requires DSH webServer and no extra key or external service.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:121-185","lib/tracker.js:250-353","lib/widget.js:489-519"]}
