{"unit_id":"TINGOD2006__dsh-tps#feature-speed","repo":"TINGOD2006/dsh-tps","commit":"155892f2515a1acb93b17b5fda50817a7905527e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tps 的功能「实时与平均吞吐」：卡片读取会话流式分片并估算实时 tokens/s，也显示当前步骤平均速度；提供方上报精确用量时用于校准估算。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:121-148","lib/tracker.js:250-321"]}
{"unit_id":"TINGOD2006__dsh-tps#feature-sessions","repo":"TINGOD2006/dsh-tps","commit":"155892f2515a1acb93b17b5fda50817a7905527e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tps 的功能「多会话读数」：按会话整理输出速度、任务标题和活动状态，并列出有读数的会话；点击会话行即可切换卡片当前显示对象。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tracker.js:398-435","lib/tracker.js:547-561"]}
{"unit_id":"TINGOD2006__dsh-tps#feature-placement","repo":"TINGOD2006/dsh-tps","commit":"155892f2515a1acb93b17b5fda50817a7905527e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tps 的功能「侧栏停靠与悬浮」：卡片可固定在侧栏底部，也可切换为浮动模式；浮动卡片支持拖动，侧栏位置不可见时会退回浮窗显示。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/widget.js:440-477","lib/widget.js:489-519","lib/widget.js:521-583"]}
{"unit_id":"TINGOD2006__dsh-tps#feature-history","repo":"TINGOD2006/dsh-tps","commit":"155892f2515a1acb93b17b5fda50817a7905527e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tps 的功能「速度趋势与显示偏好」：卡片绘制最近输出速度样本，可切换实时或平均模式并折叠显示；位置、模式和折叠状态保存在浏览器 localStorage。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/widget.js:37-49","lib/widget.js:62-100","lib/widget.js:670-700"]}
